(7404884, 1166318, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t like looking up the nose of anyone... even if they''re a gorgeous baby.  :D<br/> <br/>But, if I have to... I want it to be perfectly clean.  :D<br/> <br/>The eyes look really messed with...not natural.  <br/>I think if you''d shot from higher up, and left her eyes more natural-looking then we could enjoy the reflection of the two people in there even more.<br/> <br/>Love the colors and the focus right where it should be.</td>', 'I don''t like looking up the nose of anyone... even if they''re a gorgeous baby.  :D But, if I have to... I want it to be perfectly clean.  :D The eyes look really messed with...not natural.  I think if you''d shot from higher up, and left her eyes more natural-looking then we could enjoy the reflection of the two people in there even more. Love the colors and the focus right where it should be.', '2015-09-16 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
